        <section id="coding-standards"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Coding standards
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <h3>What are coding standards and the importance of them.</h3>
<p>Coding standards are agreed guides for best practice that the team of developers have decided to follow for a given project.  They include rules, best practice and guidelines and help to maintain consistency for coding.</p>
<p>Coding standards are important as they help your code be easier to:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Read</strong> – by allowing others to understand your code</li>
<li><strong>Understand</strong> – everyone following the coding standards will understand the same practices in use</li>
<li><strong>Maintain</strong> – It will be easier to fix bugs and reduce development time</li>
</ul>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/cp3/cp3_u2_s1_p2_image1.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
